    "Description": "Q#14 custom-event demo (PUBLISHER). Instance blueprint whose Tick graph publishes Hrot.AI.Behaviors.PingEvent every frame, setting BOTH payload fields before sending — Value=42 (int), Strength=1.5 (float) via the PublishEvent node's per-field pin defaults — Target self-defaulted. Authored with EXPLICIT pins so wires bind by stable id (edit-safe). Compiles to world.Bus.Publish(new PingEvent{ Target = self, Value = 42, Strength = 1.5f }). Pair with CustomEventSubscriberDemo.",
